  "dct:title": "Ghost Hacker #00 / 『パスワードは覚えるな』",
  "dct:description": "Read-once 45-page revision (v2): Yuto's sneaker-resale phishing case. Ren's 7-year stalled hunt finally gains traction when Nei pulls him into helping a classmate, leading to the first Vector Alignment Proof on the father's locked SIP device and Ren's decision to start a Ghost Hacker agency.",
  "gh:arc": "Arc 0",
